WEBVTT

NOTE Draft cues for "From YAML to a running Orkflow". site-media times them to the recording.

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
Write an Orkflow in the editor. Ctrl Space suggests keys and values.

00:08.000 --> 00:18.000
The engine checks the document as you type. Here a problem is underlined; fix it to apply.

00:18.000 --> 00:28.000
The panel beside the code shows the keys of the activity the cursor is in.

00:28.000 --> 00:38.000
Apply version stores an immutable version and its digest. A plan shows which tasks would run.

00:38.000 --> 00:55.000
Submit a run, and watch the graph fill in as each task starts and ends.
